---
args: { requirements: FunctionalRequirement[], candidates: SubstituteCandidate[], properties: CandidatePropertyEvidence[], conversion: QualificationGuardrail }
returns: CandidatePropertyReview[]
---
Evaluate each property independently with its source revision, unit, tolerance, and use environment. Use only an exact authorized conversion receipt. Then check interactions among flow, pressure, material, and mounting conditions as stated by the evidence. Keep original and converted values together; an unsupported conversion leaves the affected comparison unknown.
